冠","en":"Hair-Binding Crown"},"level":"1","description":{"zh":"最为普通的小冠，与官职无关，只是为了规整头发。","en":"The most ordinary small crown, unrelated to rank, merely for keeping hair tidy."},"mp":"650","evade":"6","price":"3800","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}}],"family":{"father":{"label":{"zh":"父亲","en":"Father"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10064","code":"0"}]},"family":{"label":{"zh":"亲属","en":"Relatives"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10983","code":"100"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI100115","name":{"zh":"汝南袁氏","en":"The Yuan clan of Runan"},"years":["0","207"],"desc":{"zh":"出自妫姓，虞舜之后，周武王封胡公满于陈，后裔以地为氏，汝南郡顶级望族。东汉“四世三公”之首，门生故吏遍天下。袁氏影响力冠绝一时。袁绍籍此得以平定河北，一度成为汉末最强诸侯。最终于官渡之战败给曹操，家族盛极而衰。","en":"Descended from the Gui surname and the lineage of Emperor Shun. King Wu of Zhou enfeoffed Duke Hu Man in Chen, whose descendants adopted the place name as their surname, becoming the premier prominent clan of Runan Commandery. Foremost among the Eastern Han lineages of 'Three Excellencies across Four Generations', their disciples and former subordinates spread across the realm. The Yuan clan's influence was unmatched in its era. Relying on this prestige, Yuan Shao pacified Hebei and briefly became the mightiest warlord of the late Han. Ultimately defeated by Cao Cao at the Battle of Guandu, the Family waned after reaching its zenith."},"talent":{"military":"7","commerce":"6","politics":"10"}},{"id":"GI100315","name":{"zh":"南阳袁氏","en":"The Yuan Clan of Nanyang"},"years":["190","199"],"desc":{"zh":"出自妫姓，虞舜之后，周武王封胡公满于陈，后裔以地为氏，汝南郡顶级望族。袁术得孙坚相助，一时兵势冠绝天下。袁绍、袁术兄弟内斗成为诸侯争霸前期的主旋律。奈何随着僭号称帝，此袁氏分支迅速败亡。","en":"Descended from the Gui surname, posterity of Emperor Shun. King Wu of Zhou enfeoffed Duke Hu Man in Chen, whose descendants took the land as their clan name, becoming a premier prominent house of Runan Commandery. With the assistance of Sun Jian, Yuan Shu's military might briefly eclipsed all under heaven. The feud between the brothers Yuan Shao and Yuan Shu became the defining conflict of the early warlord era. Yet after arrogantly attempting to Proclaim Emperor, this branch of the Yuan clan met a swift ruin."},"talent":{"military":"5","commerce":"6","politics":"7"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":null,"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[[["WJ10595","WJ10318","叔父"],["WJ10595","WJ10318","叔父"],["WJ10595","WJ10318","Uncle"],["WJ10595","WJ10318","叔父上"],["WJ10595","WJ10318","숙부"]]],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1045","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[41,50,41,51,34,56],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014705","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10215","name":{"zh":"汉末三杰","en":"Three Heroes of the Late Han"},"year":"185","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1051","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[41,50,41,51,34,56],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014705","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10615","name":{"zh":"十常侍之乱","en":"Turmoil of the Ten Attendants"},"year":"188","month":"11"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1045","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[41,50,41,51,34,56],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014705","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10402","name":{"zh":"诸侯讨董","en":"Coalition Against Dong Zhuo"},"year":"190","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1045","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[41,50,41,51,34,56],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014705","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10208","name":{"zh":"幽燕龙兴","en":"Dragon Rises in Youyan"},"year":"191",